<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-KASPARKOVA WINS WORLD WOMEN'S TRIPLE JUMP TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KASPARKOVA WINS WORLD WOMEN'S TRIPLE JUMP TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Sarka Kasparkova won the world women's triple jump gold medal on the third day of the world championships on Monday.</p>
<p>Rodica Mateescu of Romania took the silver and Ukrainian Yelena Govorova the bronze.</p>
</text>
